        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "二ssh-copy-id-命令的使用与原理"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "2.1 生成密钥对：ssh-keygen"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "21-生成密钥对ssh-keygen"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "ssh-keygen -t ecdsa\n# 常用参数：-t dsa | ecdsa | ed25519 | rsa | rsa1，指定加密方式"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "执行过程与产物："
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "[root@localhost .ssh]# ssh-keygen  -t ecdsa\nGenerating public/private ecdsa key pair.\nEnter file in which to save the key (/root/.ssh/id_ecdsa): 按回车或设置存储路径\nEnter passphrase (empty for no passphrase): 直接回车或设置密钥密码\n...\nYour identification has been saved in /root/.ssh/id_ecdsa.\nYour public key has been saved in /root/.ssh/id_ecdsa.pub."
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "产物权限：私钥 -rw-------（600）、公钥 -rw-r--r--（644）。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "2.2 ssh-copy-id 将公钥上传到远程主机"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "22-ssh-copy-id-将公钥上传到远程主机"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "ssh-copy-id -i /root/.ssh/id_ecdsa.pub root@192.168.123.218"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "执行过程："
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "/usr/bin/ssh-copy-id: INFO: Source of key(s) to be installed: \"/root/.ssh/id_ecdsa.pub\"\nThe authenticity of host '192.168.123.218 (192.168.123.218)' can't be established.\nECDSA key fingerprint is SHA256:Qh+4R5mpwlU6kK3bf0k53ngm+WpKKnfvL1ZJo+YM3ic.\nAre you sure you want to continue connecting (yes/no)? yes   #输入yes\n...\nroot@192.168.123.218's password:   #填入密码\nNumber of key(s) added: 1"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "2.3 ssh-copy-id 到底做了什么？"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "23-ssh-copy-id-到底做了什么"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "start": null,
        "spread": false,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "将本地主机的公钥添加到远程主机的 ~/.ssh/authorized_keys 文件里"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "在本机 ~/.ssh/ 下新建 known_hosts 文件（记录远程主机连接信息）"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "解除信任实验：清除远程主机 authorized_keys 里本地密钥后，再次登录需要密码；但因本地 known_hosts 仍存有远程主机信息，无需再输 yes。若清除 known_hosts 中的对应记录，则需重新 yes + 密码。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "2.4 跳过首次主机确认"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "24-跳过首次主机确认"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "修改 /etc/ssh/ssh_config："
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "ini",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "# 找到：\n# StrictHostKeyChecking ask\n# 修改为：\nStrictHostKeyChecking no"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 3,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "三、批量多机互相信任"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "三批量多机互相信任"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "思路：每台主机生成密钥后，把所有主机的公钥汇总到一台主机的 authorized_keys，再将该文件分发到所有主机，即可实现全互信。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "核心文件：believe.sh、sshcopy.exp、sshkeygen.exp、hosts"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "3.1 hosts 文件（IP:密码，冒号分隔）"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "31-hosts-文件ip密码冒号分隔"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": null,
        "meta": null,
        "value": "149.28.244.75:*p8V1xG{7)%sQV!\n149.28.245.101:K(1q@jsvM@UVZtk"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "3.2 believe.sh（主脚本）"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "32-believesh主脚本"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "#!/bin/bash\n# 检查本地是否有密钥文件，没有则添加。\n./sshkeygen.exp\n# 循环取出ip和密码\nfor i in $(cat ./hosts )\ndo\n    # 取出ip和密码\n    IP=$(echo \"${i}\" |awk -F\":\" '{print $1}')\n    PW=$(echo \"${i}\" |awk -F\":\" '{print $2}')\n    # 将本地的公钥复制到远程主机\n    ./sshcopy.exp $IP  $PW\n    # 将脚本sshkeygen.exp复制到远程主机\n    scp -p ./sshkeygen.exp   $IP:/root/\n    # 远程主机安装expect\n    ssh root@$IP \"yum install expect -y \"\n    # 远程主机创建密钥文件\n    ssh root@$IP \"/root/sshkeygen.exp&\"\n    # 将远程主机的公钥添加到本地authorized_keys文件\n    ssh root@$IP \"cat ~/.ssh/*.pub\" >>./authorized_keys\ndone\n# 将本地的公钥复制到远程主机\nfor i in $(cat ./hosts)\ndo\n     IP=$(echo \"${i}\" |awk -F\":\" '{print $1}')\n     # 将本地主机的公钥文件添加到authorized_keys文件\n     cat ~/.ssh/*.pub >>./authorized_keys\n     scp ./authorized_keys $IP:~/.ssh/authorized_keys\ndone"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "3.3 sshcopy.exp（将本地公钥上传到远程主机，需可执行权限）"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "33-sshcopyexp将本地公钥上传到远程主机需可执行权限"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "#!/usr/bin/expect -d\nset ip [lindex $argv 0]\nset pw [lindex $argv 1]\nset timeout 60\nspawn ssh-copy-id $ip\nexpect {\n#\"*yes/no\" {send \"yes\\r\"; exp_continue}\n# 若注释上面这行，需在 /etc/ssh/ssh_config 将 # StrictHostKeyChecking ask 改为 StrictHostKeyChecking no\n\"password:\" {send \"$pw\\r\"}\n}\nexpect eof"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "3.4 sshkeygen.exp（判断是否有密钥，无则创建，权限 755）"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "34-sshkeygenexp判断是否有密钥无则创建权限-755"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "#!/usr/bin/expect -d\nset timeout 90\nspawn ssh-keygen\nexpect {\n\".ssh/id_rsa\" {send \"\\r\";exp_continue}\n\"Overwrite (y/n)?\" exit\n\"Enter passphrase\" {send \"\\r\";exp_continue}\n\"Enter same passphrase again:\" {send \"\\r\"}\n}\nexpect eof"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "3.5 使用流程"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "35-使用流程"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "# 脚本放同目录，赋予执行权限\nchmod 755 believe.sh sshcopy.exp sshkeygen.exp\n./believe.sh"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "⚠️ 依赖 expect：yum install expect -y。执行后所有主机即可互相免密登录。"
          }
        ]
      },
